{"lines":[{"t":"Test 2","y":0.10747938757983211,"h":0.013250883392226243,"w":0.055555553436279326,"x":0.21193415692383566,"c":1},{"y":0.14726207022164606,"w":0.13221272786458332,"t":"Questions 1—8","x":0.21169737035350755,"h":0.015705733192542648,"c":1},{"y":0.17984112898631466,"w":0.69363179524739582,"x":0.21387257100099855,"h":0.017647131592983145,"c":1,"t":"Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 1?"},{"t":"In boxes 1-8 on your answer sheet, write","h":0.016401983402643094,"y":0.21060448487909023,"x":0.21180506264463303,"w":0.33974894205729167,"c":1},{"h":0.013192018434773911,"c":1,"t":"TRUE","x":0.27363446784609913,"y":0.24122375819625719,"w":0.051496496200561515},{"w":0.061728394826253252,"y":0.25726744172035731,"t":"FALSE","h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.27366255145163848,"c":1},{"h":0.014707633828386801,"c":1,"y":0.24230585765497203,"w":0.35825915018717447,"x":0.39288254331280692,"t":"if the statement agrees with the information"},{"w":0.3543328348795573,"h":0.016658629629721422,"x":0.39073077118268534,"y":0.25715588982543192,"t":"if the statement contradicts the information","c":1},{"x":0.27346168282538014,"h":0.016990074139742184,"c":1,"y":0.27170228822274245,"t":"NOT GIVEN if there is no information on this","w":0.38102350870768226},{"x":0.25289884381218314,"y":0.31096683275050929,"h":0.018511534579651046,"w":0.63410583496093742,"c":1,"t":"Henderson rarely visited the area around Press estate when he was younger."},{"y":0.33533196914161645,"t":"2 Henderson pursued a business career because it was what his family wanted.","w":0.68750035603841142,"h":0.018410666390498709,"c":1,"x":0.20768953330888962},{"y":0.35853907539451901,"h":0.018245170197863092,"t":"3 Henderson and Notman were surprised by the results of their 1865 experiment.","w":0.69164388020833334,"x":0.20973442664880168,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.20971792097359943,"y":0.38187273650526454,"h":0.019252332276253226,"w":0.69371805826822919,"t":"4 There were many similarities between Henderson's early landscapes and those"},{"x":0.24865555880397494,"c":1,"y":0.39919537757583912,"h":0.013822895899257115,"t":"of Notman.","w":0.095404624938964844},{"y":0.42191086420071,"c":1,"t":"The studio that Henderson opened in 1866 was close to his home.","x":0.23852550811185419,"w":0.55999099731445323,"h":0.017740664128279904},{"x":0.24475726117252047,"y":0.44614627565217324,"h":0.016805976804771472,"c":1,"t":"Henderson gave up portraiture so that he could focus on taking photographs of","w":0.65656992594401042},{"y":0.46110078878342708,"x":0.24821327193749776,"h":0.015046590348997357,"c":1,"t":"scenery.","w":0.073863544464111308},{"y":0.48490094349153934,"w":0.72042190551757801,"x":0.20563702007121654,"t":"7 When Henderson began work for the Intercolonial Railway, the Montreal to Halifax","h":0.019182526461507976,"c":1},{"y":0.50006882327757729,"c":1,"x":0.24875775055412272,"w":0.18773045857747392,"t":"line had been finished.","h":0.014556883642333651},{"c":1,"w":0.7060918172200521,"t":"8 Henderson's last work as a photographer was with the Canadian Pacific Railway.","y":0.52304443320463823,"x":0.20766453161042725,"h":0.019191254434933747},{"c":1,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.20164609062878672,"y":0.86482558123800246,"t":"40"}],"w":2400,"h":3395}